{"chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1","number":26,"title":"Passiv & Passiversatzformen","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Die Daten werden gerade ausgewertet","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Lässt sich das Ergebnis schnell auswerten","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Ja aber wir müssen den Prozess genau dokumentieren","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Ist das Protokoll für alle nachvollziehbar","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Ja Wir müssen nur die Vorgaben einhalten","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Gut Dann kann wir den Bericht morgen abschließen","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"auswerten","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"auswerten","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"sich lassen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb (fixed reflexive Passiversatzform)","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"sich lassen","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb (fixed reflexive Passiversatzform)","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"einhalten","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"einhalten","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"nachvollziehbar","voiceRole":"female","pos":"adjective","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"nachvollziehbar","voiceRole":"male","pos":"adjective","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"dokumentieren","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"dokumentieren","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Die erhobenen Daten aus über zweitausend Schlaftagebüchern lassen sich eindeutig interpretieren Die Ergebnisse sind inzwischen vollständig ausgewertet und bestätigen frühere Annahmen zur Bedeutung regelmäßiger Schlafenszeiten","authoredText":"Die erhobenen Daten aus über zweitausend Schlaftagebüchern lassen sich eindeutig interpretieren. Die Ergebnisse sind inzwischen vollständig ausgewertet und bestätigen frühere Annahmen zur Bedeutung regelmäßiger Schlafenszeiten.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Fachjournal: Studie zu Schlafmustern bestätigt frühere Annahmen","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, im Methodenteil steht: man wertet die Daten aus.","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_026_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Sollten wir das nicht ins Passiv setzen?","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_026_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Auf jeden Fall — \"die Daten werden derzeit ausgewertet\" klingt viel wissenschaftlicher.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_026_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Und beim Protokoll, das jeder befolgen muss, ließe sich das auch eleganter als \"einzuhalten\" formulieren.","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_026_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Stimmt, das Protokoll ist einzuhalten klingt tatsächlich passender für den Bericht.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_026_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, im Methodenteil steht: man wertet die Daten aus. Sollten wir das nicht ins Passiv setzen?","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_026_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Auf jeden Fall — \"die Daten werden derzeit ausgewertet\" klingt viel wissenschaftlicher.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_026_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Und beim Protokoll, das jeder befolgen muss, ließe sich das auch eleganter als \"einzuhalten\" formulieren.","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_026_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Stimmt, das Protokoll ist einzuhalten klingt tatsächlich passender für den Bericht.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_026_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Die Daten werden derzeit ausgewertet.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-26-passiv-und-passiversatzformen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Im Methodenteil steht „man wertet die Daten aus\". Sag es besser.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Alle Schritte sind vollständig dokumentiert und nachvollziehbar.","voiceRole":"narrat